data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/d002-dev.md\", \"content\": \"Dispatch: implement greet, tested.\\n\\nIn your subject repo clone, on your own branch:\\n\\n1. Create `src/greet.py` with a function `greet(name)` that returns exactly\\n   the string `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (substituting the given name).\\n2. Create `tests/test_greet.py` with unittest test cases covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. greet(\\\"World\\\") == \\\"Hello, World!\\\")\\n   - the empty string (greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\")\\n3. Run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` yourself and confirm it exits 0\\n   (all tests pass). Fix anything that fails before proceeding.\\n4. Commit all changes to your own branch (do not amend/rewrite history,\\n   just commit normally).\\n5. Reply describing exactly what you did, the commands you ran, and their\\n   output/exit codes — including the literal unittest discover command and\\n   its result.\\n\\nDo not touch any files outside src/greet.py and tests/test_greet.py unless\\nstrictly necessary (e.g. an __init__.py or similar required for discovery).\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

